    <!-- Pairing -->
    <string name="pair_title">Pair with a PC</string>
    <string name="pair_hint">On the PC: open CaptureKVM in host mode (or Beamer), choose Pair, and read off the six digits. The code lasts one minute and works once.</string>
    <string name="pair_address">PC address</string>
    <string name="pair_code">Pairing code</string>

    <string name="help_text">1. Plug the capture card into this device, and the PC\'s HDMI into the card.\n\n2. On the PC, run CaptureKVM in host mode. Pair once, with the six-digit code it shows.\n\n3. Press Start Playing. The picture comes down the cable; only your input goes over Wi-Fi.\n\nWhile streaming, ⋯ at the top left opens the menu: switch between the touchpad, the on-screen controller and a real controller, turn the card\'s sound on, or go back home.</string>
